# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Screenshot and comparison working folders.
#
# Every capture run during the build of this site wrote a folder of PNGs
# here — blind A/B rounds, hero direction options, benchmark captures,
# width sheets, live checks. They are working artifacts of HOW the site
# was arrived at, not the site. Together they are several gigabytes,
# which is two orders of magnitude more than the source they were taken
# of.
#
# They are listed one by one rather than as `.*/` because a blanket rule
# on dot-folders would also swallow things that DO belong in git.
#
# If you add a new capture folder, add it here in the same breath. The
# first version of this file missed five of them, and 221 MB of
# screenshots came within one `git add` of the history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.shots/
.snap/
.bench/
.bench2/
.live/
.site/
.heroes/
.directions/

# A stray capture written to the site root by a one-off check.
x.png
